ine\" data-tex=\"P,\\leq_P\\in V\">\\(P,\\leq_P\\in V\\)</span> (forcing poset carrier and order; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"58-df-poset\">58-df-poset</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\in V\">\\(\\kappa\\in V\\)</span> (infinite-cardinal size parameter)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq P\">\\(A\\subseteq P\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\subseteq A\">\\(B\\subseteq A\\)</span> (large set and centered witness)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset},\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S,\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S,\\mathrm{CenteredFamilyPoset}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset},\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S,\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S,\\mathrm{CenteredFamilyPoset}_S\\)</span> (source predicates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing10PrecaliberPoset}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing10PrecaliberPoset}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing10\\text{-}precaliber\\text{-}poset} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing10PrecaliberPoset}_S(P,\\leq_P,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\land\\forall A\\subseteq P\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S(A,\\kappa)\\to\\exists B\\subseteq A\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S(B,\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{CenteredFamilyPoset}_S(B,P,\\leq_P)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing10\\text{-}precaliber\\text{-}poset} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing10PrecaliberPoset}_S(P,\\leq_P,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\land\\forall A\\subseteq P\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S(A,\\kappa)\\to\\exists B\\subseteq A\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S(B,\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{CenteredFamilyPoset}_S(B,P,\\leq_P)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Thus every subset equinumerous with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> contains a centered subfamily equinumerous with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>; both size claims use the registered predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-poset","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-poset]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-centered-family-poset","status":"resolved","id":"2d0b5355f34d1101","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-centered-family-poset]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-equinumerous","status":"resolved","id":"28c79fde9f892bfe","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-equinumerous]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-poset","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$P,\\leq_P\\in V$ (forcing poset carrier and order; see [[58-df-poset]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"P,\\leq_P\\in V","display":false},{